---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy — Eco" description="Privacy policy for Eco, the real-time transcription and translation app for macOS." canonical="https://ecotranslate.app/en/privacy">
  <Nav lang="en" />
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <a href="/en/" class="back-link">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/></svg>
          Back to home
        </a>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: June 2, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-body">

        <section>
          <h2>1. What information we collect</h2>
          <h3>1.1 Account information</h3>
          <p>When you create an account through Google Sign-In, we collect your name, email address, and profile photo as provided by Google.</p>
          <h3>1.2 Usage data</h3>
          <p>We record aggregated usage metrics: recording minutes consumed per period, number of translation tokens used, and your active plan. This information is necessary for quota management and billing.</p>
          <h3>1.3 Audio and transcription data</h3>
          <p>Audio captured by Eco is transmitted in encrypted form to our AI processing providers for transcription. <strong>We do not store or have access to audio recordings.</strong> Transcriptions and translations are processed in real time and displayed locally on your device. We do not retain transcribed or translated content on our servers.</p>
          <h3>1.4 Technical data</h3>
          <p>We may log anonymous error and technical data (app version, error codes, operating system) to improve application stability.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>To provide, maintain, and improve the service.</li>
            <li>To manage your account, subscription, and usage quota.</li>
            <li>To send transactional emails related to your account (payment receipts, quota notifications).</li>
            <li>To detect and prevent fraud or service abuse.</li>
            <li>To comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties for advertising purposes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Legal basis for processing (EU/EEA users)</h2>
          <p>If you are located in the European Union or European Economic Area, we process your data under the following GDPR legal bases:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Performance of contract:</strong> to provide the service you have subscribed to.</li>
            <li><strong>Legitimate interest:</strong> to improve the security and stability of the service.</li>
            <li><strong>Legal obligation:</strong> when required by applicable law.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Data sharing with third parties</h2>
          <h3>4.1 AI transcription provider</h3>
          <p>Audio data is sent to our transcription provider for real-time processing. The provider does not retain audio recordings beyond the time needed to generate the transcription.</p>
          <h3>4.2 AI translation provider</h3>
          <p>Transcribed text is sent to our translation provider. The provider processes text under its own privacy terms and does not use it to train models without explicit consent.</p>
          <h3>4.3 Supabase</h3>
          <p>Supabase, Inc. provides our database and authentication infrastructure. Account and usage data is stored on Supabase servers in the us-east-1 (AWS) region.</p>
          <h3>4.4 Paddle</h3>
          <p>Payments are processed by Paddle.com Market Ltd., acting as Merchant of Record. Paddle collects and processes payment data (name, address, card or payment method information). See <a href="https://www.paddle.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Paddle's privacy policy</a> for details.</p>
          <h3>4.5 Google</h3>
          <p>We use Google OAuth for authentication. Google may process data according to its own policies when you sign in.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. International data transfers</h2>
          <p>Your data may be processed on servers located outside Chile, including the United States. For EU/EEA users, these transfers are made under appropriate safeguards (Standard Contractual Clauses or equivalent certifications).</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Data retention</h2>
          <p>We retain your account data while you maintain an active account. Usage data is kept for a maximum of 13 months for analytics and billing purposes. You may request account deletion at any time by writing to <a href="mailto:hello@ecotranslate.app">hello@ecotranslate.app</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Access the personal information we hold about you.</li>
            <li>Correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data ("right to be forgotten").</li>
            <li>Request data portability.</li>
            <li>Object to the processing of your data.</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent at any time (without affecting prior processing).</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To exercise any of these rights, write to us at <a href="mailto:hello@ecotranslate.app">hello@ecotranslate.app</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Security</h2>
          <p>We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your data: encryption in transit (TLS), short-lived authentication tokens, and role-based access control. However, no security system is infallible.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Minors</h2>
          <p>Eco is not directed to persons under 13 years of age. If you become aware that a minor has provided us with personal information, please contact us to have it removed.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy periodically. We will notify you of significant changes by email or through an in-app notice. Continued use of the service after notification implies acceptance of the changes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>11. Contact</h2>
          <p>For any privacy-related questions:<br/>
          <a href="mailto:hello@ecotranslate.app">hello@ecotranslate.app</a></p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>

<style>
.legal-page {
  padding-top: 120px;
  padding-bottom: 80px;
  min-height: 100svh;
}
.legal-header { max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
.back-link {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; transition: color 0.15s;
}
.back-link:hover { color: var(--cyan); }
.legal-header h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 52px); font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
.legal-meta { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-faint); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
.legal-body { max-width: 720px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; }
.legal-body section h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.legal-body section h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); }
.legal-body p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-body ul { padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-body li { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
.legal-body a { color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
.legal-body a:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
.legal-body strong { color: var(--text); }
</style>
